              Growing Teams
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Plus</h3>
            <div class="text-4xl font-heading text-primary font-bold mb-4">
              $750<span class="text-lg font-normal text-gray-500">/mo</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="font-body text-body text-base space-y-2 list-disc list-inside mb-8">
              <li><strong>Up to 15 updates/mo</strong></li>
              <li>≤ 3 new pages/mo; quarterly CRO refresh</li>
            </ul>
            <a
              href="#contact"
              class="mt-auto px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-white font-heading font-semibold text-lg shadow hover:bg-secondary transition text-center"
              >Get WaS</a
